  <title>4.14.2: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01116</md:content-id>
    <md:title>4.14.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>bcc61588-c1fb-4b45-9220-7a153cfe2acf</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <note class="self-check"><title>Self Check</title>
<para>The table below shows the number of chips in a game and the number of moves that can be made.</para>
<table class="os-raise-horizontaltable">
  <tgroup cols="5"><tbody><row>
      <entry><emphasis>Number of chips</emphasis></entry><entry>
        1
      </entry>
      <entry>
        2
      </entry>
      <entry>
        3
      </entry>
      <entry>
        4
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry><emphasis>Number of possible moves</emphasis></entry><entry>
        3
      </entry>
      <entry>
        5
      </entry>
      <entry>
        7
      </entry>
      <entry>
        9
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody></tgroup></table>

<para>How many moves would be possible with 7 chips?</para></note>
</content>
</document>